    bigIdea: 'Every medium rewrites man\'s contract with truth — oral truth bent to the tribe, print held it fixed for 500 years, likes-and-shares turned it into a referendum, and A.I. speaks language with no ground — but the Word was settled in heaven before any medium existed, and it does not bend, burn, or expire. The essay\'s own survival strategies — embodied life and deep reading — are Yahweh\'s ancient commands, and this app is machinery for keeping them.',
