        'Sunk cost named of old: "Pride goeth before destruction" (Proverbs 16:18); "a fool returneth to his folly" (Proverbs 26:11); count the cost (Luke 14:28); turn, don\\\'t cover (Proverbs 28:13). Our lane is the class thesis: sovereign, small, sharp. Provenance honest (DR-0076 SS8): the video/Atlantic figures carried as reported, not independently re-verified.',
