      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): read Zechariah 4:6 and Ecclesiastes 10:10 aloud (KJV). | Recap last week (10): the sealed trace — what did binding-to-the-owner teach? | Teach the arc (15): the bet (scaling laws) → diminishing returns (Haggai 1:6) → the resource drain (Jeremiah 2:13) → bigger-as-name (Babel, the barns) → wisdom over force (Ecclesiastes 10:10) → the sunk-cost trap and the turn (Proverbs 28:13). | Hands-on in the app (25): revisit Week 1 (the generator in the garage) and Week 2 (what a model costs to run) — name one place we chose sovereign-and-small over big-and-rented, and why. | Discussion (15): the prompts below. | Send-off (5): the R→P→E — whet one edge, stop digging one hole.',
