  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Week 17 - captured 2026-09-14 by the Gmail-lesson-intake Way (DR-0312):
  // Darrell forwarded (from dpoe@illinois.edu, "Lesson." marker) a ByteByteGo
