  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Week 24 - captured 2026-09-18 by the Gmail-lesson-intake Way (DR-0312):
  // Darrell forwarded (from dpoe@illinois.edu) the ByteByteGo piece Migrations
  // at Scale: Changing the Application Engine at 30,000 Feet (Sep 17 2026) with
  // one word: Lessons. The forward arrived as a PAYWALLED PREVIEW - only the
  // framing came through, and it cut off at What Exactly is Being Replaced.
  // So the honest provenance IS part of the teaching (DR-0076): we carry its
  // framing as its own claim, we refuse to invent the key strategies it promised
  // and did not deliver, and the worked example is this house own migration,
  // measured from the files rather than remembered. The Word leads: count the
  // cost before you touch the running thing (Luke 14:28-31); the work continues
  // while the wall is rebuilt (Nehemiah 4:17-20; 6:15); the field before the
  // house (Proverbs 24:27); by little and little (Exodus 23:30; Deuteronomy
  // 7:22); prove all things with two witnesses (1 Thessalonians 5:21; 2
