        'TIER ONE: 3-2-1 (search-verified, CISA document not fetched); RTO and RPO as the two numbers every plan states (search-verified); restic\'s README fetched verbatim 2026-09-24 from github.com - "Much more important than backup is restore", "Saving a backup on the same machine is nice but not a real backup strategy.", and the key: "Losing your password means that your data is irrecoverably lost."',
