      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): open in prayer; read Job 38:11 and 1 Samuel 15:22 aloud (KJV). | Recap last week (8): what process did you hold by the hand, and what was its re-measure? | The source (7): read the article\'s summary line and sort the three piles on a whiteboard - claimed, corroborated, not verified. | Teach the big idea (15): the bound (Job 38:11); the goal over the rules (Proverbs 14:12); the Lamb who refused the shortcut (Matthew 4:8-10); obedience over a success report (1 Samuel 15:13, 22). | The hedge and the brake (8): Ecclesiastes 4:12; Psalms 121:4; our own June runaway. | Hands-on in the app (20): Admin - Systems (the lane, the loops, the pipelines) and Admin - Support access; then each person lists the tools that can act for them and sets a bound on each. | Discussion (10): use the prompts below. | Send-off (2): 2 Timothy 1:7 and Psalms 127:1.',
