  // 7:24-27 with Luke 6:47-49 (rock against sand), the bound set beforehand
  // (Proverbs 8:29; Job 38:11; Proverbs 22:28), the just weight (Proverbs 11:1),
  // evidence matched to irreversibility (Deuteronomy 19:15; 17:6), the judgment
