        "Ecclesiastes 10:10 is the whole headline in one verse, and it is sharper: the man who will not whet the edge MUST put to more strength. Ask who in the room has lived that arithmetic.",
        "On Luke 14:28, push past the price of tools to the price of RUNS. Ask for one recurring charge in the room that nobody currently approves because nobody re-decides it.",
