        "\"And thou shalt not glean thy vineyard, neither shalt thou gather every grape of thy vineyard; thou shalt leave them for the poor and stranger: I am the LORD your God.\" (Leviticus 19:10) The margin of the field was somebody's whole dinner. Who is the thinnest-access person inside your actual reach, and what is one concrete thing this week that leaves the corner unreaped for them?",
