        "\"Not because we have not power, but to make ourselves an ensample unto you to follow us.\" (2 Thessalonians 3:9) Paul laid down a right to leave an ensample. Which apostolic pattern have you been treating as optional because it was inconvenient, and which have you been using as a club because it was convenient?",
        "\"Thus saith the LORD, Stand ye in the ways, and see, and ask for the old paths, where is the good way, and walk therein, and ye shall find rest for your souls. But they said, We will not walk therein.\" (Jeremiah 6:16) Ask for the old paths. What is one thing in your house or your work that you have been running as an experiment when the Word already handed you the pattern?"
