        "Open with the provenance, out loud, before any teaching: this is an IT Brew newsletter from 2026-10-21, written by Brianna Monsanto and Caroline Nihill, forwarded by Darrell with one word above it, \"Lesson.\" It is trade press, not Scripture. It carries sponsored segments from PwC and JumpCloud, which we name as advertising and use for nothing. Saying this first is the habit that keeps the room able to tell a source from the Word.",
